# SakkirinaSolo.cs -> SakkirinaGen.cs  (self-play data-generation agent)
#
# WHY THIS IS A PATCH AND NOT A SOURCE FILE
# SakkirinaGen is 885 lines of code, of which only 39 differ from SakkirinaSolo,
# the 2025 competition winner. Shipping it as a source file would amount to
# redistributing someone else's competition entry under a different class name.
# The patch carries only our changes; scripts/fetch_baselines.sh applies it to
# the author's own file, fetched from the competition archive.
#
# SakkirinaSolo is the work of its author and is NOT covered by this
# repository's licence. See README.md, "Third-party agents".
#
# WHAT THE PATCH CHANGES (three things, nothing else)
#
#   1. Rename.  class SakkirinaSolo -> class SakkirinaGen, so both can be
#      loaded as separate opponents in the same GameRunner process.
#
#   2. Exploration sampling.  ENABLE_EXPLORATION / EXPLORATION_TURNS /
#      EXPLORATION_TEMPERATURE and Node.SampleChildByVisits. For the first
#      EXPLORATION_TURNS turns the root move is sampled proportional to visit
#      count instead of taking BestChild(); after that the behaviour is stock
#      SakkirinaSolo. Without this, self-play between two deterministic
#      instances replays nearly the same game every time and the generated
#      training set collapses onto one trajectory.
#
#   3. Null-move fix.  In Play(), bestMove comes from a tree that may have been
#      built under a different determinization, so it can have no isomorphic
#      match in the current possibleMoves, leaving `move` null. Upstream then
#      returns null and the engine scores it as an illegal move. bestMove is
#      not a safe substitute (it need not be legal in this state), so we fall
#      back to possibleMoves[0], which always is. ProceedTree() additionally
#      gets a try/catch so a tree-reuse failure costs a cache miss, not the
#      game. Both log once via BotLog (defined in Bots/src/DeepSetsCore.cs).
#
# APPLY
#   patch -o Bots/src/SakkirinaGen.cs Bots/src/SakkirinaSolo.cs \
#         < scripts/sakkirina_gen.patch
#   (done for you by scripts/fetch_baselines.sh)
#
# BASE: ScriptsOfTribute-CompetitionsArchive commit
#       105aaa72b2cdc4544873f75cd0356d47929dadea
#       competition-2025-08-COG/cs_agents/SakkirinaSolo/SakkirinaSolo.cs
